Package: nowcastfoundation
Title: Simulations to Fine-Tune Time Series Foundation Models for Nowcasting
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Sam", "Abbott", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "contact@samabbott.co.uk")
Description: The simulator's original R engine, kept as the reference
    the Python simulator's draws and latent step are tested against: the
    grid's factors and sampling distributions (read from a YAML file), the
    designs and values, and the latent infections and expected onsets.
